1
00:00:00,228 --> 00:00:02,998
(Leonard:)Okay.

2
00:00:02,999 --> 00:00:04,999
(Sheldon:)Do you want to say it?

3
00:00:05,001 --> 00:00:07,071
(Amy:)Let's say
it together.

4
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:10,200
BOTH:
We're getting a turtle!

5
00:00:12,374 --> 00:00:17,344
(Penny:)This is why I've been saying
we should keep champagne on ice.

6
00:00:17,346 --> 00:00:18,516
(Sheldon:)Sarcasm?

7
00:00:18,514 --> 00:00:19,814
(Amy:)Yes.
Okay.

8
00:00:19,816 --> 00:00:21,916
(Sheldon:)That was tricky,
'cause when it comes to alcohol,

9
00:00:21,918 --> 00:00:24,388
(Sheldon:)she generally means business.

10
00:00:24,387 --> 00:00:26,157
Well, we're-we're
very happy for you.

11
00:00:26,155 --> 00:00:27,355
(Amy:)Yes.

12
00:00:27,356 --> 00:00:28,686
(Amy:)Thank you.

13
00:00:28,691 --> 00:00:31,791
(Amy:)Acquiring a joint pet
is a big step for us.

14
00:00:31,794 --> 00:00:33,064
(Sheldon:)No. It's true.

15
00:00:33,062 --> 00:00:35,392
(Sheldon:)It means that we care so much
about each other,

16
00:00:35,398 --> 00:00:37,868
(Sheldon:)there's enough left over
for an eight-ounce reptile.

17
00:00:37,867 --> 00:00:39,837
(Leonard:)Why a turtle?

18
00:00:39,836 --> 00:00:43,836
(Sheldon:)After much deliberation,
we've determined that a turtle

19
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,070
(Sheldon:)is the ideal pet.

20
00:00:45,074 --> 00:00:48,574
(Sheldon:)They don't shed fur,
they don't make noise...

21
00:00:48,578 --> 00:00:50,578
(Amy:)For Halloween, we can dress him
as a cobblestone.

22
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,450
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

23
00:00:52,581 --> 00:00:55,621
(Sheldon:)And if he ever goes berserk,
I know I can outrun him.

24
00:00:55,618 --> 00:01:00,288
(Sheldon:)Coincidentally, that's also
why I chose you as a roommate.

25
00:01:00,289 --> 00:01:01,489
(Leonard:)Well, congratulations.

26
00:01:01,491 --> 00:01:03,621
(Leonard:)Who would've thought
you two would be the first

27
00:01:03,626 --> 00:01:05,556
(Leonard:)in our group
to start a family?
Mm-hmm.

28
00:01:05,561 --> 00:01:09,001
That's what I said!

29
00:01:08,998 --> 00:01:12,598
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

